Proof of Concept
The following proof of concept illustrates how the previously described attack  can take place. Follow the steps in order to reproduce it:
Create a
ERC777Mock.sol
file in
lib/accounts-v2/test/utils/mocks/tokens
and paste the code found in
this github gist
.
Import the ERC777Mock and change the MockOracles, MockERC20 and Rates structs in
lib/accounts-v2/test/utils/Types.sol
to add an additional
token777ToUsd
,
token777
of type ERC777Mock and token777ToUsd rate:
----new code block----
import "../utils/mocks/tokens/ERC777Mock.sol"; // <----- Import this
​
...
​
