Recommendation
To address the vulnerability and restore secure operation, it is recommended that:
Mandatory submission of a known and verified
restaker
address be enforced within the
claimCompletedWithdrawals()
function.
The function should reject calls that contain a zero-length array for withdrawal requests, ensuring only legitimate redemption operations can trigger a decrease in
_pendingWithdrawalAmount
.
