Multiplication and division operations should not be done directly on top of fetched oracle price, without paying attention to new order of evaluation:
----new code block----
 File: contracts/libraries/LibOrders.sol
​
 812 function _updateOracleAndStartingShort(address asset, uint16[] memory shortHintArray)
 813               private
 814           {
