----end of code block ----
:br
The effective calculation being done above is:
----new code block----
    (oracleN / oracleD) * (1.01 ether)        // division before multiplication
----end of code block ----
:br
Which should have been:
----new code block----
    (oracleN * 1.01 ether) / oracle
----end of code block ----
:br
Similar multiplication or division operations have been done on
price
at various places throughout the code, which can be clubbed under this root cause itself.
