again without reentering (say on zero original nouns balance) to obtain 1 stETH and 75 ETH, while the same amount is left for Alice. Bob stole 25 ETH from Alice.
The attacking function logic can be as simple as
{ quit() as long as there is forkedNoun on my balance, perform joinFork() on the callback as long as there is noun on my balance }
