Recommended Mitigation Steps
Add constructors and use OZ Initializable's
\_disableInitializers()
function as the only line of code in the constructor.
----new code block----
 /// @custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow constructor
 constructor() {
        _disableInitializers();
    }
