It is also possible to drain all vault reserves held by the
BunniHub
by modifying the token ratio bounds of the malicious hook as follows:
----new code block----
minRawTokenRatio0: 0,           // set to 0% in order to have all deposited funds accounted into the vault
targetRawTokenRatio0: 0,        // set to 0% in order to have all deposited funds accounted into the vault
maxRawTokenRatio0: 0,           // set to 0% in order to have all deposited funds accounted into the vault
----end of code block ----
With this modification, the target raw balance for the vault to drain is set to 0% in order to have all the liquidity accounted into the vault. This way, when the
BunniHub
attempts to transfer the funds to the hook, it will have to withdraw the funds from the vault which can be exploited to repeatedly burn vault shares from other pools.
