In order to verify the validity of the issue at hand, a PoC has been created. To execute the proof of concept and verify its claim create a new
test/Swap.audit.t.sol
and insert the following content. Run the test case via
forge t --mt testBuyFt_corrected_apr_poc -vv
:
----new code block----
// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
pragma solidity ^0.8.27;
