withdrawInterest()
at a certain time may not be in the best interest of the specific
lender
.
It's unconventional and can potentially cause leak of value for the
lender
. For example, the lender may still want to accrued more interest from the strategy.
Recommended Mitigation Steps
Change to:
----new code block----
function withdrawInterest(uint256 _id, address _lender) external nonReentrant {
 require(msg.sender == _lender);
    _withdrawInterest(_id, _lender);
}
----end of code block ----
