----end of code block ----
Remediation
Refer to the SIWS standard for creating the login message. It includes all necessary information to ensure users do not inadvertently sign a malicious message.
Patch
The fix landed on commit
080d98b
by changing the message to a user-readable prompt asking for permissions to sign into Fuse Wallet:
_routers/auth.rs rust
----new code block----
let nonce = Uuid::new_v4().to_string();
// Loosely based upon Sign-in with Solana standard:
let message_text = format!(
    r###"Fuse Wallet wants you to sign in with your Device Key.
    Version: 1
    Nonce: {nonce}"###
);
let offchain_message = OffchainMessage::new(0, message_text.as_bytes())
----end of code block ----
