From
EIP-4337
:
Call the account with the
UserOperation
’s calldata.
It’s up to the account to choose how to parse the calldata; an expected workflow is for the account to have an execute function that parses the remaining calldata as a series of one or more calls that the account should make.
Impact
This breaks the interaction with EntryPoint.
