MockChainlinkAggregator::getRoundData()
with the below
getRoundData()
function. It reverts with a
RoundId doesn't exist error
, which is the root cause of the issue. Since Chainlink doesn't provide data for every
roundID
, there will be
roundIDs
for which
getRoundData()
reverts
