    }
----end of code block ----
The total value of deposited assets comprises three parts: the assets in
LRTDepositPool
, the assets in
NodeDelagator
, and the assets in the eigenlayer. Anyone can directly contribute asset tokens to
LRTDepositPool
or
NodeDelegator
to augment the total value of deposited assets.
