Summary
The formula used in
SafeCall.callWithMinGas()
is not fully complying with EIP-150 and EIP-2929, the actual gas received by the sub-contract can be less than the required
_minGas
. Withdrawal transactions can be finalized with less than specified gas limit, may lead to loss of funds.
Vulnerability Detail
----new code block----
File: contracts\libraries\SafeCall.sol
