is caused by transferring value. We can see the actual received gas in the sub-contract is less than the 63,000
_minGas
limit in both 1st and 3rd call.
Impact
SafeCall.callWithMinGas()
is a key design to ensure withdrawal transactions will be executed with more gas than the limit specified by users. This issue breaks the specification. Finalizing withdrawal transactions with less than specified gas limit may fail unexpectedly due to out of gas, lead to loss of funds.
