When executing the test, process will revert with the array out-of-bounds access error, causing a permanent denial of service.
Impact
Impact: High
Likelihood: Medium
Tools Used
Manual Review
Recommendations
It is required to modify the
CalculateNewWeights
function to pack the correct array. As
movingAverages[_pool]
does not require to contain the previous values, a valid solution is the following:
----new code block----
​
> UpdateRule.sol
​
    function CalculateNewWeights(
        int256[] calldata _prevWeights,
        int256[] calldata _data,
        address _pool,
        int256[][] calldata _parameters,
        uint64[] calldata _lambdaStore,
        uint64 _epsilonMax,
        uint64 _absoluteWeightGuardRail
