The following
mintTokenizedPosition
function eventually calls the
_createLegInAMM
function below.
https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-panoptic/blob/855f58414589e93fa62e34890118164e8ac7822f/contracts/SemiFungiblePositionManager.sol#L504-L527
----new code block----
