https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-08-foundation/blob/main/contracts/NFTDropCollection.sol#L171-L187
Impact
When calling the following
_mint
or
mintCountTo
function for minting an NFT of a NFT collection or NFT drop collection, the OpenZeppelin's
ERC721Upgradeable
contract's
_mint
