After a more thorough review, it is evident that the
InterchainTokenService.expressReceiveTokenWithData
, and, under certain conditions such as the use of ERC-777 tokens,
InterchainTokenService.expressReceiveToken
functions are vulnerable to reentrancy due to violating the CEI-pattern.
