Recommendation
We recommend completely refactoring the
fetchAllTicketCommentsCount()
function in line with these suggestions. This refactoring will not only make the code more readable and maintainable but also improve its performance.
As a future improvement, one should also investigate more optimized mechanisms to fetch tickets, such as server-side push instead of client-side pull or smarter algorithms to fetch only new comments. This would significantly improve user performance with many tickets/comments and reduce both server and client-side load. (see
