The modifiers
onlyRole
(bytes32 role) and
checkRole
(bytes32 role) are not implemented correctly. This would allow anybody to call sensitive functions that should be restricted.
Proof of Concept
For the POC, I set up a new foundry projects and copied the folders lybra, mocks and OFT in the src folder of the new project. I installed the dependencies and then I created a file
POCs.t.sol
in the test folder. Here is the code that shows a random address can call sensitive functions that should be restricted:
