 public
        onlyOwner {
​
        _mint(to, id);
    }
----end of code block ----
https://github.com/Cyfrin/2024-07-ark-project/blob/main/apps/blockchain/ethereum/src/token/ERC721Bridgeable.sol#L57
In the function
_mint
, Since the NFT is already minted and is owned by the bridge, it does not allow to mint it again. So, it reverts.
