        }
    }
----end of code block ----
https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/v5.0.2/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol#L289
A simple malicious contract can be implemented as follows:
----new code block----
// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
