Current Implementation of ExpressRelay
The current implementation of ExpressRelay does not offer a direct way for the owner to claim accumulated ETH. Thus, while the contract receives ETH through
receive
and
callWithBid
validation process, there is no way for the owner to directly retrieve these funds. This may result in a situation where ETH gets locked in the contract indefinitely.
