Importing Genesis State
In the genesis, the code does not check for duplicates before importing an account within
ImportState
. If
ImportState
is called with a
genesisState
that contains duplicate accounts (i.e., accounts with the same account number or address), since there is no validation to ensure that the account numbers and addresses in the imported
GenesisState
are consistent and follow the expected format, it may result in inconsistent or invalid account data.
