----end of code block ----
Since the owner is the vault and the only way the vault can call
_finalize
is through
batchClaimWithdrawal
, the issue has been downgraded from high to low due to the protocol design. However, be sure before production or future releases that the
_finalize
external function is not called by the vault for security reasons.
The
batchClaimWithdrawal
function, is calling first the
prepareWithdrawal
(
claimWithdrawal
private function) instead of
_finalize
.
